    "body": "FWIW a common pattern for this is to just immediately invoke an async function to waitUntil():\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\naddEventListener('install', evt => {\r\n  evt.waitUntil(async function() {\r\n    await stuff();\r\n  }());  // <---- See the extra parens here.\r\n});\r\n```",
